249
00:15:49,713 --> 00:15:52,490
I own a villa on a thousand-acre
plot of land in Hawaii.

250
00:15:52,573 --> 00:15:55,070
My gorgeous model of a
wife is 25 years younger,

251
00:15:55,153 --> 00:15:57,388
and I pay more taxes than anyone else.

252
00:15:57,633 --> 00:16:00,430
I've destroyed every enemy
who's ever stood in my way,

253
00:16:00,513 --> 00:16:02,250
and someday I'll become president.

254
00:16:02,333 --> 00:16:04,653
I'm THE Senator Phillips, damn it!

255
00:16:05,353 --> 00:16:07,653
Listen to me, you punk band reject!

256
00:16:07,973 --> 00:16:11,750
I'm gonna make sure you rot in prison
for the rest of your miser - Hear this,

257
00:16:11,833 --> 00:16:13,153
as I won't repeat it.

258
00:16:15,993 --> 00:16:17,333
Drive the car.

259
00:16:20,193 --> 00:16:22,153
This psychopath's gonna kill me!

260
00:16:22,653 --> 00:16:24,790
I have to get the hell out of this car!

261
00:16:24,873 --> 00:16:26,433
If I don't, I'm a goner!

262
00:16:27,393 --> 00:16:28,873
Someone help me!

263
00:16:31,453 --> 00:16:33,653
What the hell?!

264
00:16:37,473 --> 00:16:38,813
What was that?

265
00:16:39,153 --> 00:16:41,010
I'm positive I jumped out of the car.

266
00:16:41,093 --> 00:16:43,510
So what the hell am I
doing back in the car?

267
00:16:43,593 --> 00:16:44,913
I don't get it.

268
00:16:45,273 --> 00:16:46,633
What's going on?

269
00:16:46,933 --> 00:16:49,168
Your job is to catch up to that truck.

270
00:16:49,393 --> 00:16:51,453
Fail to do so and you die.

271
00:16:52,453 --> 00:16:53,393
Yes, sir.

272
00:16:53,993 --> 00:16:55,873
How am I still in the car?

273
00:16:56,273 --> 00:16:57,913
Of course, that's it.

274
00:16:58,073 --> 00:16:58,953
I'm a senator.

275
00:16:59,473 --> 00:17:00,433
What can't I do?

276
00:17:00,653 --> 00:17:02,633
Yes, it makes total sense now.

277
00:17:12,013 --> 00:17:14,993
I still sense Dio's sinister bloodlust.

278
00:17:15,193 --> 00:17:16,750
Its presence is overwhelming.

279
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:18,373
He's coming for us.

280
00:17:18,553 --> 00:17:20,830
You can bet your ass he's on our trail.

281
00:17:20,913 --> 00:17:24,384
Are you saying that Dio somehow
knows our precise location?

282
00:17:24,753 --> 00:17:25,583
Not quite.

283
00:17:25,853 --> 00:17:29,029
He stole the body of my
grandfather, Jonathan Joestar.

284
00:17:29,573 --> 00:17:33,455
I can sense his body, but I can't
tell if he's nearby or far away.

285
00:17:33,633 --> 00:17:37,339
I have a general feeling, but I
don't know exactly where he is.

286
00:17:37,493 --> 00:17:39,270
It's like when we got to Cairo,

287
00:17:39,353 --> 00:17:42,570
and while I knew he was here,
I couldn't pinpoint his lair.

288
00:17:42,653 --> 00:17:45,124
Lucky for us, the same thing goes for Dio.

289
00:17:46,013 --> 00:17:47,570
All he knows is that we're nearby,

290
00:17:47,653 --> 00:17:50,594
but he's unable to tell
the difference between us.

291
00:17:50,793 --> 00:17:54,793
And he probably doesn't know we've
separated, which is good for now.

292
00:17:56,993 --> 00:17:58,875
Why the hell isn't this working?

293
00:17:59,093 --> 00:18:02,799
Cars always start up when they
do this kind of thing in movies.

294
00:18:07,533 --> 00:18:09,474
Seems like there's a traffic jam.

295
00:18:10,073 --> 00:18:11,193
I'm sorry, sir.

296
00:18:11,393 --> 00:18:13,670
The evening commute is
always bumper to bumper.

297
00:18:13,753 --> 00:18:14,583
Move it.

298
00:18:15,033 --> 00:18:16,268
But we're stuck here.

299
00:18:16,453 --> 00:18:18,170
There's just too much traffic.

300
00:18:18,253 --> 00:18:20,170
Have you forgotten there's a sidewalk?

301
00:18:20,253 --> 00:18:22,090
Use it the sidewalk!

302
00:18:22,173 --> 00:18:27,353
But it's covered with people heading
home from work and your point go!

303
00:18:28,033 --> 00:18:28,873
Yes, sir!

304
00:18:31,093 --> 00:18:31,923
Faster!

305
00:18:41,013 --> 00:18:44,673
Okay, it's running hurry
up and get on Polnareff.

306
00:18:44,813 --> 00:18:45,643
Oh, yeah

307
00:18:50,333 --> 00:18:52,273
Oh, the things I do for you!

308
00:18:52,593 --> 00:18:55,470
But I've done everything you've
asked, so you'll spare my life, right?

309
00:18:55,553 --> 00:18:58,082
There's no need to kill
a helpless senator!

310
00:18:58,613 --> 00:18:59,443
Wrong.

311
00:19:02,413 --> 00:19:03,707
I have to be dreaming?

312
00:19:03,893 --> 00:19:05,470
What other explanation is there?

313
00:19:05,553 --> 00:19:07,610
As if a senator like me could be killed!

314
00:19:07,693 --> 00:19:08,523
Woo-hoo-hoo!

315
00:19:08,606 --> 00:19:09,753
It's just a dream!

316
00:19:11,293 --> 00:19:12,123
Found you.

317
00:19:12,353 --> 00:19:13,353
Now get closer.

318
00:19:13,553 --> 00:19:14,690
We need to catch up to them.

319
00:19:14,773 --> 00:19:17,833
I can't use the world
if I'm this far away.

320
00:19:18,533 --> 00:19:19,913
Look, here he comes.

321
00:19:20,293 --> 00:19:21,293
You see that car?

322
00:19:21,473 --> 00:19:22,753
That's Dio's ride.

323
00:19:25,153 --> 00:19:25,983
Kakyoin!

324
00:19:29,513 --> 00:19:30,793
It's Kakyoin's.

325
00:19:31,013 --> 00:19:32,213
Take this, Dio!

326
00:19:32,513 --> 00:19:33,693
Emerald Splash!

327
00:19:52,233 --> 00:19:53,063
Unbelievable.

328
00:19:53,146 --> 00:19:55,370
He deflected my attack
with the flick of a finger.

329
00:19:55,453 --> 00:19:56,733
He barely moved.

330
00:19:57,193 --> 00:19:58,664
But how do you like this?

331
00:20:03,673 --> 00:20:07,353
He even dodged the
concentrated splash? Damn it!

332
00:20:09,633 --> 00:20:11,490
When did he bring out his stand?

333
00:20:11,573 --> 00:20:13,279
How could I have missed that?

334
00:20:17,913 --> 00:20:19,153
Well, that's a shame.

335
00:20:19,353 --> 00:20:20,647
He's too far away now.

336
00:20:21,073 --> 00:20:24,544
My punch seems to have thrown
him out of the world's range.

337
00:20:27,933 --> 00:20:28,953
What's happening?

338
00:20:29,593 --> 00:20:33,593
And what precisely would I gain by
explaining this situation to you?

339
00:20:33,813 --> 00:20:35,931
Pay attention to the road and drive.

340
00:20:40,553 --> 00:20:42,193
Be careful, Kakyoin.

341
00:20:42,413 --> 00:20:44,433
You were way too close to it.

342
00:20:44,773 --> 00:20:46,173
Please, forgive me.

343
00:20:46,533 --> 00:20:47,973
I didn't mean...

344
00:20:49,713 --> 00:20:52,350
It was only a few months
ago when Dio asked

345
00:20:52,433 --> 00:20:55,139
me if I was really going
to vomit out of fear.

346
00:20:55,393 --> 00:20:58,687
That monster had the audacity
to tell me I should relax.

347
00:20:59,593 --> 00:21:01,253
Bastard! Never again!

348
00:21:01,533 --> 00:21:03,239
I'll never lose to you again!

349
00:21:03,633 --> 00:21:05,233
Are you alright, Kakyoin?

350
00:21:05,393 --> 00:21:07,569
Did you catch a glimpse of the world?

351
00:21:07,673 --> 00:21:08,503
Yes.

352
00:21:08,586 --> 00:21:11,573
I saw it when I attacked
Dio from ten meters away.

353
00:21:11,853 --> 00:21:14,690
If I had gotten any closer,
I would have been done for.

354
00:21:14,773 --> 00:21:16,550
But we know one thing for certain.

355
00:21:16,633 --> 00:21:20,809
His stand holds a power more horrific
than we could have ever imagined.

356
00:21:20,893 --> 00:21:23,993
However, we know two
things about it. First,

357
00:21:24,233 --> 00:21:27,910
his stand doesn't have the reach of my
Hierophant Green or your Hermit Purple.

358
00:21:27,993 --> 00:21:31,073
It's a close-range power
stand, like Star Platinum.

359
00:21:31,213 --> 00:21:33,213
It has a range of about 10 meters.

360
00:21:33,533 --> 00:21:34,363
Second,

361
00:21:34,446 --> 00:21:38,722
it attacked with its fist, so it doesn't
use projectile weapons like bullets.

362
00:21:38,913 --> 00:21:39,993
That being said,

363
00:21:40,233 --> 00:21:42,470
if we can sneak up on
him and get within range,

364
00:21:42,553 --> 00:21:44,870
We just might have a chance
of finishing him off!

365
00:21:44,953 --> 00:21:49,150
We have to figure out his
secret even so we have to

366
00:21:49,233 --> 00:21:52,468
exercise extreme caution when
approaching this bastard.

367
00:21:53,473 --> 00:21:56,493
Hold on why does car suddenly stop?

368
00:22:00,933 --> 00:22:03,093
Incoming we're about to be hit

369
00:22:08,353 --> 00:22:09,183
Mr.

370
00:22:09,266 --> 00:22:10,096
Joestar

371
00:22:37,053 --> 00:22:39,113
What are you doing, Kakyoin?

372
00:22:39,353 --> 00:22:40,773
I understand now.

373
00:22:42,773 --> 00:22:46,093
I know now how to uncover
the secret of Dio's stand.

374
00:23:27,793 --> 00:23:30,028
Whenever I think about Avdol and Iggy,

375
00:23:30,113 --> 00:23:33,310
it makes the hairs on the
back of my neck stand on end.

376
00:23:33,393 --> 00:23:36,950
I'm sure it's because they were the
first to treat me like a friend.

377
00:23:37,033 --> 00:23:39,915
My friends and I were on
a journey to defeat Dio.

378
00:23:40,153 --> 00:23:42,173
All right, here it comes!

379
00:23:43,133 --> 00:23:43,416
Thank you.
